<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila poultry, hog producers buy 23,000 T corn.</title>
<headline>Manila poultry, hog producers buy 23,000 T corn.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine poultry and hog producers bought 23,000 tonnes of Chinese yellow corn for July arrival, industry officials and traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Officials and traders said the buyers included poultry and feeds maker Vitarich Corp and hog producer Purina Philippines.</p>
<p>Other details of the transaction were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8936, Fax 817-6267</p>
